<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <%- include('./partials/head') %>
    <title>About Blogify</title>
</head>

<body>

    <%- include('./partials/nav') %>

    <main class="about-page">

        <!-- Blogify Logo -->
        <div class="about-logo">
            <a href="/" class="navbar-brand">
                
                Blogify
            </a>
        </div>


        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <section class="about-hero">

            <span class="about-badge">ABOUT BLOGIFY</span>

            <h1>
                A simple space for<br>
                <span>ideas worth sharing.</span>
            </h1>

            <p>
                Blogify is a modern blogging platform built to make
                writing, publishing, and discovering ideas simple.
                It focuses on a clean reading experience without
                unnecessary distractions.
            </p>

        </section>


        <!-- Main Content -->
        <section class="about-content">


            <!-- The Idea -->
            <div class="about-block">

                <span class="section-label">THE IDEA</span>

                <h2>
                    Built for people who have something to say.
                </h2>

                <p>
                    Blogify was created with a simple idea:
                    publishing content should be easy, clean,
                    and accessible.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Whether it is a personal experience, a technical
                    article, or an idea worth discussing, Blogify
                    provides a focused place to share it.
                </p>

            </div>


            <!-- The Experience -->
            <div class="about-block">

                <span class="section-label">THE EXPERIENCE</span>

                <h2>
                    Simple by design.
                </h2>

                <p>
                    From creating an account to publishing a blog,
                    every part of Blogify is designed around simplicity.
                </p>

                <p>
                    The goal is to create an experience that feels
                    natural and keeps the content at the center.
                </p>

            </div>


            <!-- Creator -->
            <div class="author-card">

                <div class="author-avatar">
                    M
                </div>

                <div class="author-info">

                    <span class="section-label">
                        THE CREATOR
                    </span>

                    <h2>
                        Mani Sai Murali Thatipelli
                    </h2>

                    <p>
                        Developer and creator of Blogify, interested in
                        web development, backend technologies, and
                        building practical projects through learning.
                    </p>

                    <div class="author-links">

                        <a
                            href="https://github.com/manisaimuralithatipelli"
                            target="_blank"
                            rel="noopener noreferrer">
                            GitHub ↗
                        </a>

                        <span>
                            LinkedIn · Verification Pending
                        </span>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- Footer -->
        <section class="about-footer">

            <h2>
                Thanks for visiting Blogify.
            </h2>

            <p>
                Read something interesting. Share an idea.
                Keep building.
            </p>

        </section>

    </main>


    <%- include('./partials/scripts') %>

</body>

</html>